  "post_content": "<p>(12 fotos) L&#39;Ajuntament d&#39;Onda ha organitzat de divendres 10 a diumenge 12 d&#39;agost una nova edici&oacute; de la Fira Medieval, que comptar&agrave; amb una &agrave;mplia programaci&oacute; que inclou m&eacute;s de 50 activitats per a tots els p&uacute;blics i que &quot;espera congregar a milers de visitants a la localitat, en ser l&#39;&uacute;nica fira medieval de la prov&iacute;ncia de Castell&oacute; que se celebra a l&#39;interior i voltants d&#39;un castell de l&#39;&egrave;poca&quot;, segons destaca una nota del Gabinet de Comunicaci&oacute; municipal.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenfiramedievalonda18/p7192198.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenfiramedievalonda18/p7192202.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenfiramedievalonda18/p7192205.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenfiramedievalonda18/p7192207.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenfiramedievalonda18/p7192208.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenfiramedievalonda18/p7192209.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenfiramedievalonda18/p7192210.jpg\" alt=\"OLYMPUS DIGITAL CAMERA\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presenfiramedievalonda18/p7192212.jpg\" alt=